sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 사용자
    participant UI as Next.js UI
    participant API as ServerController
    participant SS as ServerService
    participant ES as EncryptionService
    participant SSH as SshMultipassExecutor
    participant Rem as 원격 서버

    User->>UI: 서버 등록 폼 입력<br/>(host, port, username, privateKey)
    UI->>API: POST /api/servers
    API->>SS: createServer(req)
    SS->>SS: existsByName() 중복 확인
    SS->>ES: encrypt(privateKey)
    ES-->>SS: encryptedKey
    SS->>SS: Server(status=UNKNOWN) 저장
    SS-->>API: ServerResponse
    API-->>UI: { id, name, status: UNKNOWN }

    User->>UI: SSH 연결 테스트 클릭
    UI->>API: PUT /api/servers/{id} (폼 최신화)
    UI->>API: POST /api/servers/{id}/test
    API->>SS: testConnection(id)
    SS->>ES: decrypt(privateKey)
    ES-->>SS: plainKey
    SS->>SSH: new SshMultipassExecutor(host, port, user, key)
    SSH->>Rem: SSH 연결 + echo ok
    alt 연결 성공
        Rem-->>SSH: ok
        SSH-->>SS: 성공
        SS->>SS: status = CONNECTED, lastSeenAt = now
        SS-->>API: { success: true }
        API-->>UI: 연결 성공 토스트
    else 연결 실패
        Rem-->>SSH: 오류
        SSH-->>SS: Exception
        SS->>SS: status = UNREACHABLE
        SS-->>API: { success: false, message }
        API-->>UI: 오류 메시지 표시
    end

    User->>UI: Multipass 설치 확인 클릭
    UI->>API: POST /api/servers/{id}/multipass/check
    API->>SS: checkMultipass(id)
    SS->>SSH: execRaw("multipass version")
    alt 설치됨
        SSH-->>SS: "multipass 1.x.x"
        SS-->>UI: { installed: true, version }
    else 미설치
        SSH-->>SS: command not found
        SS-->>UI: { installed: false }
        User->>UI: Multipass 설치 클릭
        UI->>API: POST /api/servers/{id}/multipass/install
        API->>SS: installMultipass(id)
        SS->>SS: status = INSTALLING_MULTIPASS
        SS-->>UI: { jobId }
        Note over SS,Rem: @Async — 백그라운드 설치
        SS->>SSH: execRawStreaming("sudo snap install multipass")
        SSH->>Rem: 설치 실행
        Rem-->>SSH: 로그 스트리밍
        SS->>SS: status = CONNECTED
        UI->>API: GET /api/jobs/{jobId} (polling)
        API-->>UI: { status: SUCCESS }
    end

    Note over SS,Rem: 60초마다 자동 점검 (@Scheduled)
    SS->>SSH: execRaw("echo ok")
    SSH->>Rem: heartbeat
    Rem-->>SSH: ok
    SS->>SS: lastSeenAt = now
